  "announcement_github_body": "## Install etna 0.1.3\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Download etna 0.1.3\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [etna-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [etna-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [etna-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [etna-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/alpaylan/etna-cli/releases/download/v0.1.3/etna-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n",
